<title>USA: TABLE - Ford June US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Ford June US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co</p>
<p>			Jun 1-30, 1997     Jun 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   156,715	   150,644	     +4.0</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 196,796	   187,117	     +5.2</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,230	     3,802	    +11.3</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jun 30, 1997 Jan 1-Jun 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   815,707	   884,375	     -7.2</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     1,116,775	 1,073,787	     +4.7</p>
<p> Import Car		17,799	    24,894	    -28.0</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 153 for year to date vs 154 in year ago.</p>
</text>
